        "id": 95813,
        "name": "JimmytheRat",
        "username": "JimmytheRat",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-16T01:57:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nope, you can only hit a particular target once.</p><p>There are ways to deal that damage to a single target, but they generally involve redirection shenanigans.&nbsp; For instance, if Mr. Fixer has both Dual Crowbars and Driving Mantis, he can hit one target for 2 damage, then hit himself for 2 damage but redirect that second instance of damage to the same target as the first.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:22:45.296Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
