        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-16T01:58:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is one quirk, though. &nbsp;There are some cards which read \"Deal one target 1 &lt;type&gt; damage. &nbsp;Deal one target 1 &lt;type&gt; damage.\" &nbsp;These cards can hit the same target twice. &nbsp;If the second line was \"Deal one <strong>other </strong>target...\" it wouldn't work.</p>",
