        "id": 95815,
        "name": "Edwin",
        "username": "Edwin",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-16T05:58:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A much more abstruse question along these lines.&nbsp; Say Tachyon plays a Sonic Vortex with four Bursts in her trash, and all other heroes are incapacitated, so the only targets that exist are Tachyon, Apostate, and a Relic Spirit, the latter at 6 HP and a single Tome of the Unknowable being the only Relic in the trash .&nbsp; You cannot currently choose four targets for the Vortex, but after you hit the Relic Spirit, and hit yourself but redirect it with Synaptic Interruption to also hit the Relic Spirit, you finish it off, and the Tome of the Unknowable enters play.&nbsp; Can you now choose the Tome as the fourth target of your Sonic Vortex (well, the third, since you still haven't resolved your hit against Apostate)?&nbsp; Or were you \"locked into\" the targets you had to choose for it, before you started resolving any of the hits?</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:22:45.448Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
