        "id": 95816,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-16T06:55:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Edwin\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Edwin:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can you now choose the Tome as the fourth target of your Sonic Vortex (well, the third, since you still haven't resolved your hit against Apostate)?&nbsp; Or were you \"locked into\" the targets you had to choose for it, before you started resolving any of the hits?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You can choose the Tome as the new target. You go on choosing targets for as long as you need to, just making sure never to pick a target you had already picked before.</p>",
