        "created_at": "2014-03-16T13:33:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>End of Days works that way as well.</p><p>If destroying a card brings out more targets the End of Days will attempt to destroy them until all valid targets are destroyed, before it attempts to destroy itself.</p>",
